RipsMath_CalculatePrizeAmount
├── it should never revert.
├── when the prize number is in the first tier
│   └── it should return the prize for that position.
├── when the prize number is in the last tier
│   └── it should return the prize for that position.
└── when the prize number is in a middle tier
    └── it should return the prize for that position.
